    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφρον-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφρων</span>)
